        "x1": 0.8827576965844932,
        "y1": 0.4463421239422506
      },
      "text": "(f) is obtained from this by the trick of using the product correspon-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
